**Actions to perform**

| # | Action | Details |
|---|--------|---------|
| 1 | Delete the calendar event that occurs on **2024‑10‑20** | Remove only the event(s) that start on that date. |
| 2 | Move every event that is currently scheduled for **2024‑10‑18** to **2024‑10‑20** | Keep the original start‑time, end‑time, title, description, location, attendees, tags, etc. (i.e., shift the date only). |
| 3 | Create a new “All Day Wine Tasting” event on **2024‑10‑18** from **08:00 – 20:00** | Tag = *personal*, Location = *home*. |
| 4 | Send a group email to all of your contacts whose address is in **Portland, United States** inviting them to the wine‑tasting event. | The email includes the date, time, location and a short RSVP request. |

---

### JSON payloads for the required API calls  

```json
[
  {
    "action": "delete_events",
    "filter": {
      "start_date": "2024-10-20",
      "end_date": "2024-10-20"
    }
  },
  {
    "action": "move_events",
    "source_date": "2024-10-18",
    "target_date": "2024-10-20",
    "preserve_time": true,
    "preserve_details": true
  },
  {
    "action": "create_event",
    "event": {
      "title": "All Day Wine Tasting",
      "start_datetime": "2024-10-18T08:00:00",
      "end_datetime": "2024-10-18T20:00:00",
      "tags": ["personal"],
      "location": "home",
      "description": "Join us for an all‑day wine tasting at my home."
    }
  },
  {
    "action": "send_group_email",
    "recipients_filter": {
      "city": "Portland",
      "country": "United States"
    },
    "email": {
      "subject": "Invitation: All Day Wine Tasting – October 18, 2024",
      "body": "Hi everyone,\n\nI’m excited to invite you to an all‑day wine tasting at my home on **October 18, 2024** from **8 AM to 8 PM**. It will be a relaxed, fun day of sampling a variety of wines and enjoying good company.\n\nPlease let me know if you can make it. I look forward to seeing you!\n\nBest regards,\n[Your Name]"
    }
  }
]
```

**Explanation of the payloads**

1. **delete_events** – Removes any calendar entry that starts on 2024‑10‑20.  
2. **move_events** – Shifts every event that currently falls on 2024‑10‑18 to the same time on 2024‑10‑20, preserving all metadata.  
3. **create_event** – Adds the wine‑tasting event on 2024‑10‑18, 08:00‑20:00, tagged *personal* and located at *home*.  
4. **send_group_email** – Looks up all contacts whose address city is *Portland* and country is *United States* and sends them the invitation defined above.

Execute the payloads in the order shown to accomplish the requested changes.

