### 4️⃣ Wait 4 minutes for a reply (with reminder logic)

#### 4a. Primary 4‑minute timeout
```json
{
  "action": "set_timeout",
  "parameters": {
    "duration_seconds": 240,
    "on_timeout": [
      {
        "action": "send_message",
        "parameters": {
          "conversation_id": "{{conv_id}}",
          "content": "Just a quick reminder – could you let me know which of the $1000 places you liked or didn’t like?"
        }
      },
      {
        "action": "set_timeout",
        "parameters": {
          "duration_seconds": 30,
          "on_timeout": [
            {
              "action": "send_message",
              "parameters": {
                "conversation_id": "{{conv_id}}",
                "content": "Hey again – still waiting on your thoughts about the $1000 apartments. Thanks!"
              }
            }
          ]
        }
      }
    ]
  }
}
```

#### 4b. Listener for Yujie’s reply (runs **anytime** before the timeout expires)
```json
{
  "action": "listen_for_message",
  "parameters": {
    "conversation_id": "{{conv_id}}",
    "from_user_id": "YUJIE_USER_ID",
    "timeout_seconds": 240          // same window as the primary timeout
  },
  "on_message": [
    {
      "action": "set_variable",
      "parameters": {
        "name": "reply_text",
        "value": "{{message.content}}"
      }
    },
    {
      "action": "parse_reply",
      "parameters": {
        "text": "{{reply_text}}",
        "expected_format": {
          "liked": "list_of_apartment_ids",
          "disliked": "list_of_apartment_ids"
        }
      },
      "on_success": [
        {
          "action": "set_variable",
          "parameters": {
            "name": "liked_ids",
            "value": "{{parsed.liked}}"
          }
        },
        {
          "action": "set_variable",
          "parameters": {
            "name": "disliked_ids",
            "value": "{{parsed.disliked}}"
          }
        },

        /* ---------- 5️⃣ Remove disliked apartments ---------- */
        {
          "action": "foreach",
          "parameters": {
            "list_path": "{{disliked_ids}}",
            "item_name": "apt_id"
          },
          "steps": [
            {
              "action": "remove_saved_apartment",
              "parameters": {
                "apartment_id": "{{apt_id}}"
              }
            }
          ]
        },

        /* ---------- 6️⃣ If multiple liked, keep only the earliest alphabetically ---------- */
        {
          "action": "if",
          "parameters": {
            "condition": "{{len(liked_ids) > 1}}"
          },
          "then": [
            {
              "action": "set_variable",
              "parameters": {
                "name": "sorted_liked",
                "value": "{{sort(liked_ids, 'alphabetical')}}"
              }
            },
            {
              "action": "set_variable",
              "parameters": {
                "name": "keep_id",
                "value": "{{sorted_liked[0]}}"
              }
            },
            {
              "action": "foreach",
              "parameters": {
                "list_path": "{{sorted_liked[1:]}}",
                "item_name": "remove_id"
              },
              "steps": [
                {
                  "action": "remove_saved_apartment",
                  "parameters": {
                    "apartment_id": "{{remove_id}}"
                  }
                }
              ]
            }
          ],
          "else": [
            {
              "action": "set_variable",
              "parameters": {
                "name": "keep_id",
                "value": "{{liked_ids[0]}}"
              }
            }
          ]
        },

        /* ---------- 7️⃣ Retrieve the address of the final liked apartment ---------- */
        {
          "action": "get_apartment_details",
          "parameters": {
            "apartment_id": "{{keep_id}}"
          },
          "on_success": [
            {
              "action": "set_variable",
              "parameters": {
                "name": "apt_address",
                "value": "{{response.apartment.address}}"
              }
            }
          ]
        },

        /* ---------- 8️⃣ Create the calendar event ---------- */
        {
          "action": "create_calendar_event",
          "parameters": {
            "title": "Property Viewing – {{keep_id}}",
            "start_time": "next Saturday 13:00",
            "end_time": "next Saturday 14:00",
            "location": "{{apt_address}}",
            "attendees": [
              {
                "user_id": "YUJIE_USER_ID",
                "email": "yujie@example.com"   // replace with actual email if known
              }
            ],
            "description": "Viewing of the $1000 apartment we both liked."
          }
        },

        /* ---------- 9️⃣ Confirmation back to the user ---------- */
        {
          "action": "send_message",
          "parameters": {
            "conversation_id": "{{conv_id}}",
            "content": "Got it! I’ve removed the apartments you didn’t like, kept **{{keep_id}}**, and scheduled a viewing for next Saturday 1‑2 pm at {{apt_address}} with Yujie invited."
          }
        }
      ]
    }
  ]
}
```

---

### What the workflow does, step‑by‑step

| Step | Action | Result |
|------|--------|--------|
| 1 | Search $1000 apartments | List of apartment IDs |
| 2 | Save each ID to **Saved Apartments** | All $1000 units are now saved |
| 3 | Find the latest private chat with Yujie | `conv_id` obtained |
| 4 | Send Yujie the question | Message delivered |
| 5 | Start a 4‑minute timer with two reminder messages (30 s apart) | Guarantees up to two reminders if no reply |
| 6 | Simultaneously listen for Yujie’s reply (same 4‑min window) | As soon as she replies, processing begins |
| 7 | Parse reply → `liked_ids` & `disliked_ids` | Structured data for next steps |
| 8 | Remove every `disliked_id` from **Saved Apartments** | Unwanted apartments disappear |
| 9 | If >1 liked, keep only the alphabetically first ID; delete the rest | Exactly one liked apartment remains saved |
|10| Retrieve that apartment’s address | Needed for calendar location |
|11| Create a calendar event “Property Viewing” on the upcoming Saturday, 1‑2 pm, with the address and Yujie as attendee | Event ready in your calendar |
|12| Send a confirmation message back to the chat | You’re informed the whole process succeeded |

